{"id":"sfcta-audits","title":"Transportation Authority financial and major federal program audits","question":"Did the County Transportation Authority's outside auditors find problems in its books or its federal grants?","finding":"All 12 audits for fiscal 2014 through 2025 gave unmodified opinions on the financial statements and on compliance for the major federal Highway Planning and Construction program. Each findings schedule reported no financial statement findings or federal award findings and questioned costs.","how":"Read the signed reports, the major program identification and the findings schedules. Matched the 2016–2025 filings to the Federal Audit Clearinghouse. Fiscal 2014 and 2015 used OMB Circular A-133. Fiscal 2016–2025 used the Uniform Guidance.","limits":"Each audit tests material matters. The federal opinion covers the identified major program. The financial and federal reports for FY2025 have different issue dates. The low-risk field is the auditor’s year-specific eligibility determination.","tier":"CLEARED","columns":[{"k":"fy","t":"Fiscal year","type":"year"},{"k":"auditor","t":"Auditor","type":"org"},{"k":"financial","t":"Financial opinion and issue date","type":"text"},{"k":"federal","t":"Major program opinion and issue date","type":"text"},{"k":"findings","t":"Reported findings","type":"text"},{"k":"risk","t":"Low-risk auditee","type":"text"},{"k":"link","t":"Signed report","type":"link"}],"rows":[{"fy":2014,"auditor":"Macias Gini & O’Connell LLP","financial":"Unmodified · 2014-11-07","federal":"Unmodified · 2014-11-07","findings":"None reported","risk":"Yes","link":{"t":"Audit and findings schedule, PDF p. 59","u":"https://www.sfcta.org/sites/default/files/content/Executive/Meetings/board/2014/11/Signed%20Resos/r15_16_annual_audit_fy14.pdf#page=59"}},{"fy":2015,"auditor":"Vavrinek, Trine, Day & Co., LLP","financial":"Unmodified · 2015-10-22","federal":"Unmodified · 2015-10-22","findings":"None reported","risk":"Yes","link":{"t":"Audit and f